WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.507
Who's who in rural India?

2
00:00:02.507 --> 00:00:04.321
Daniel Thorner sorted them into

3
00:00:04.321 --> 00:00:05.673
three classes.

4
00:00:06.009 --> 00:00:08.322
Thorner set this out in

5
00:00:08.322 --> 00:00:10.684
1956, using Hindi words for

6
00:00:10.684 --> 00:00:11.917
each class.

7
00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:13.868
Maliks, who earn from land

8
00:00:13.868 --> 00:00:14.551
and rent.

9
00:00:14.551 --> 00:00:16.499
Kisans, working peasants.

10
00:00:16.499 --> 00:00:17.389
And mazdoors,

11
00:00:17.389 --> 00:00:18.981
who earn wages from others'

12
00:00:18.981 --> 00:00:19.854
land.

13
00:00:20.177 --> 00:00:22.007
The syllabus also covers the

14
00:00:22.007 --> 00:00:24.308
industrial working class and the

15
00:00:24.308 --> 00:00:26.024
growing middle classes.

16
00:00:26.356 --> 00:00:27.533
Your turn.

17
00:00:27.533 --> 00:00:29.290
Who are mazdoors?
